	(text "02 Two synchronous bucks from the raw rail (UIN), 50 kHz center-aligned, 180 deg apart (PLAN D5, D9). IKP08N65F5 on the chassis east wall; 2 mH toroid; filter variant D (sim/ripple.py): 47 uF + 4.7 uF film through the I_C shunt, 100 uH, 10 uF film + 22 uF / 2.2 ohm damping leg. Low-side and capacitor shunts 50 mohm (Kelvin taps on sheet 04). No protection hardware (PLAN D2)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 17.78 0)
		(effects
